{"product_id":"youre-gonna-need-a-bigger-boat","title":"You're Gonna Need A Bigger Boat","description":"\u003cp\u003eBringing together perspectives from history, philosophy, technology, and neuroscience, You're Gonna Need A Bigger Boat explores concepts of time, and offers a clear, practical strategy for building a stronger, healthier relationship with the future through Scenario Thinking. The book provides a five-step framework to upgrade your thinking capabilities and learn how to re-think future scenarios, by applying questioning, contextualizing, modelling, reasoning, and learning. This framework will empower you to understand past events, recognize present problems, and imagine future possibilities.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mohamed Marwan\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781922456892\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 176\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45652477214873,"sku":"12RF9781922456892","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a1fee2e57c2_You_re_Gonna_Need_A_Bigger_Boat_Mohamed_Marwan.jpg?v=1755526983","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/youre-gonna-need-a-bigger-boat","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}